      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 18,
      "number": 117,
      "number_raw": "117",
      "source_number": "117",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "听说你救了坦蒂。你做得很好。你的命很硬。我感觉你的未来很有希望。",
      "source_text": "听说你救了坦蒂。你做得很好。你的命很硬。我感觉你的未来很有希望。",
      "source_line_start": 18,
